<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Air Jordan Sneaker Resale Market Analysis (2023–2026)</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #1a1a2e;
    --accent: #e63946;
    --accent2: #457b9d;
    --accent3: #2a9d8f;
    --accent4: #e9c46a;
    --light: #f8f9fa;
    --mid: #dee2e6;
    --text: #212529;
    --muted: #6c757d;
    --success: #2a9d8f;
    --danger: #e63946;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --section-bg: #f8f9fa;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f0f2f5;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .page-wrapper { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px 60px; }

  /* HEADER */
  .report-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, #16213e 60%, #0f3460 100%);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 52px 48px 40px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .report-header::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 40%;
    background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='400' height='300' viewBox='0 0 400 300' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Ccircle cx='350' cy='50' r='120' fill='rgba(230,57,70,0.08)'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='300' cy='250' r='80' fill='rgba(69,123,157,0.08)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E") no-repeat right center;
  }
  .header-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .report-header h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .report-header .subtitle {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .header-meta {
    display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    padding-top: 18px; margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .header-meta span strong { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }

  /* KPI CARDS */
  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .kpi-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent2);
    position: relative;
  }
  .kpi-card.accent-red { border-left-color: var(--accent); }
  .kpi-card.accent-green { border-left-color: var(--success); }
  .kpi-card.accent-yellow { border-left-color: var(--accent4); }
  .kpi-card.accent-blue { border-left-color: var(--accent2); }
  .kpi-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .kpi-value {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--primary);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .kpi-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* SECTIONS */
  .section {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .section-header {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 18px 28px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
  }
  .section-number {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    width: 24px; height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .section-header h2 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }
  .section-body { padding: 28px; }
  .section-intro {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  /* SUBSECTIONS */
  .subsection { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .subsection h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mid);
  }

  /* CHARTS */
  .chart-wrap {
    background: #fafbfc;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 18px 16px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--mid);
  }
  .chart-title {
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px; margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .chart-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .chart-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* TABLES */
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  table {
    width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  thead tr { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
  thead th {
    padding: 10px 14px; text-align: left;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  thead th.right { text-align: right; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f7f8fa; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: #eef2ff; }
  tbody td {
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mid);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  tbody td.right { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
  }
  .badge-green { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }
  .badge-red { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
  .badge-yellow { background: #fef9c3; color: #854d0e; }
  .badge-blue { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
  .pos { color: var(--success); font-weight: 600; }
  .neg { color: var(--danger); font-weight: 600; }

  /* CALLOUT BOXES */
  .callout {
    display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 18px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .callout-info { background: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; }
  .callout-success { background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid var(--success); }
  .callout-warn { background: #fffbeb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; }
  .callout-icon { font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
  .callout-text { font-size: 13px; }
  .callout-text strong { color: var(--primary); }

  /* INSIGHT GRID */
  .insight-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .insight-card {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--mid);
  }
  .insight-card .ic-label {
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .insight-card .ic-value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); }
  .insight-card .ic-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }

  /* CONDITION BARS */
  .cond-bar-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .cond-bar-label { width: 200px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .cond-bar-track { flex: 1; background: #e9ecef; border-radius: 4px; height: 20px; overflow: hidden; }
  .cond-bar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding-left: 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
  .cond-bar-val { width: 80px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: right; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* RECOMMENDATIONS */
  .rec-list { list-style: none; }
  .rec-list li {
    display: flex; gap: 14px;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mid);
  }
  .rec-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .rec-num {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
    min-width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .rec-content strong { font-size: 14px; color: var(--primary); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .rec-content p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }

  /* FOOTER */
  .report-footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 24px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mid);
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  /* DIVIDER */
  hr.divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--mid); margin: 20px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="report-header">
  <div class="header-tag">Market Intelligence Report</div>
  <h1>Air Jordan Sneaker Resale<br>Market Analysis</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">A comprehensive analysis of 5,000 secondary-market transactions examining pricing dynamics, profit margins, inventory velocity, and channel performance — 2023 through 2026.</p>
  <div class="header-meta">
    <span><strong>Dataset:</strong> 5,000 transactions</span>
    <span><strong>Period:</strong> Jan 2023 – Sep 2025</span>
    <span><strong>Models Covered:</strong> 5 Air Jordan silhouettes</span>
    <span><strong>Channels:</strong> 5 sales platforms</span>
    <span><strong>Report Date:</strong> April 2026</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page-wrapper">

  <!-- KPI DASHBOARD -->
  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card accent-green">
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg Profit Margin</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">$82.06</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Per transaction across all 5,000 sales</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card accent-blue">
      <div class="kpi-label">Resale Premium Rate</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">61.3%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Transactions clearing above retail</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card accent-yellow">
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg Days in Inventory</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">22.5</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Mean holding period before sale</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card accent-red">
      <div class="kpi-label">Resale-to-Retail Ratio</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">1.43×</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Mean resale as multiple of MSRP</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card accent-blue">
      <div class="kpi-label">Top Colorway Margin</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">$89.23</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Pine Green — highest avg across all colorways</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SECTION 1: MARKET OVERVIEW -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-number">1</div>
      <h2>Market Overview &amp; Transaction Summary</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p class="section-intro">This dataset spans 5,000 Air Jordan secondary-market transactions from January 2023 through September 2025, covering five silhouettes, nine colorways, five sales channels, and three condition tiers. The overall market shows a 43% average premium to MSRP, though the distribution is highly bimodal — nearly 39% of transactions close below retail.</p>

      <div class="insight-grid">
        <div class="insight-card">
          <div class="ic-label">Avg Retail Price</div>
          <div class="ic-value">$191.17</div>
          <div class="ic-desc">Weighted mean MSRP across all transactions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-card">
          <div class="ic-label">Avg Resale Price</div>
          <div class="ic-value">$273.23</div>
          <div class="ic-desc">Mean secondary-market clearing price</div>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-card">
          <div class="ic-label">Margin Std Dev</div>
          <div class="ic-value">$159.07</div>
          <div class="ic-desc">High volatility — wide range from −$114 to +$575</div>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-card">
          <div class="ic-label">Median Margin</div>
          <div class="ic-value">$35.27</div>
          <div class="ic-desc">Median significantly lower than mean — right-skewed distribution</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout callout-warn">
        <div class="callout-icon">⚠</div>
        <div class="callout-text"><strong>Distribution alert:</strong> The mean profit margin of $82.06 is pulled up by extreme outliers (max: $574.58). The median of $35.27 and the fact that 38.7% of transactions close below retail indicate that the typical trade is considerably less profitable than the headline average suggests. Condition is the primary driver of this bifurcation — see Section 3.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3>Profit Margin Distribution</h3>
        <div class="chart-wrap">
          <div class="chart-title">Profit Margin Frequency Distribution (USD)</div>
          <canvas id="marginHistChart" height="90"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3>Transaction Volume by Year</h3>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Year</th>
                <th class="right">Transactions</th>
                <th class="right">Avg Resale Price</th>
                <th class="right">Avg Profit Margin</th>
                <th class="right">Avg Days in Inventory</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>2023</td><td class="right">1,816</td><td class="right">$272.50</td><td class="right"><span class="pos">$80.84</span></td><td class="right">21.97</td></tr>
              <tr><td>2024</td><td class="right">1,913</td><td class="right">$274.06</td><td class="right"><span class="pos">$81.61</span></td><td class="right">23.16</td></tr>
              <tr><td>2025 (Jan–Sep)</td><td class="right">1,271</td><td class="right">$273.03</td><td class="right"><span class="pos">$84.47</span></td><td class="right">22.16</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px;">2025 is a partial year (through September). Year-over-year margin shows a modest upward trajectory (+4.5% from 2023 to 2025 annualized run-rate).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SECTION 2: MODEL & COLORWAY -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-number">2</div>
      <h2>Performance by Shoe Model &amp; Colorway</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p class="section-intro">Five Air Jordan silhouettes are represented in the dataset. The Air Jordan 11 Retro and Air Jordan 4 Retro lead in average profit margin and resale price, while the Air Jordan 1 Low anchors the low end with the lowest MSRP, resale price, and margin. Colorway-level performance shows meaningful variation, with Pine Green delivering the highest average margin at $89.23.</p>

      <div class="subsection">
        <h3>Shoe Model Performance Comparison</h3>
        <div class="chart-grid">
          <div class="chart-wrap">
            <div class="chart-title">Average Profit Margin by Model (USD)</div>
            <canvas id="modelMarginChart" height="160"></canvas>
          </div>
          <div class="chart-wrap">
            <div class="chart-title">Avg Resale Price vs Retail Price by Model</div>
            <canvas id="modelPriceChart" height="160"></canvas>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Shoe Model</th>
                <th class="right">Transactions</th>
