  <!-- SECTION 3: CONDITION IMPACT -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-number">3</div>
      <h2>Impact of Shoe Condition on Resale Value</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p class="section-intro">Condition is the single most powerful price driver in this dataset — more impactful than model or colorway selection. The spread between Deadstock and Used average margins spans $321.67, and the two tiers operate in entirely separate economic zones: every Deadstock transaction closed above retail; every Used transaction closed below.</p>

      <div class="callout callout-success">
