        <div class="callout-text"><strong>Critical finding:</strong> Deadstock shoes have a 100% rate of selling above retail with an average margin of $264.01, while Used shoes have a 0% rate and average a $57.66 loss. VNDS occupies middle ground with an 83.3% premium rate and $37.62 average margin. Condition is a binary outcome determinant for profitability.</div>
